te_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1174885-help-developing-a-idea-superheroes?p=1176876#post1176876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good points on the Technocrats and Camerilla. I can just picture a Proginator making a Captain America-style hero to test a new steroid. Also, i am thinking that the only clan of vampires that would hate these &quot;heroes&quot; in general would be the Giovonnis. I wonder how the Camerilla and Sabbat would interact with these heroes?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;It makes the bad evil, and the good into the truly great...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;And you just injected me with it without even a single background check and not knowing me at all?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;...Shit, you're right. What the hell was I thinking?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T13:14:22-08:00","id":1177030,"title":"","content":"That was actually kinda funny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T13:33:33-08:00","id":1177034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1174885-help-developing-a-idea-superheroes?p=1177022#post1177022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;It makes the bad evil, and the good into the truly great...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;And you just injected me with it without even a single background check and not knowing me at all?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;...Shit, you're right. What the hell was I thinking?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Back when the Marvel movies were in phase one, I kept thinking that there had to be some sort of potential alternate universe/what if? story where the Avengers ended up being Stane's Iron Monger, Blonsky's Abomination, the thuggish jerk that was their first pick to be Captain America and ... well, I could never come up with an idea for Thor. I guess at this point, the group would also include Yellow Jacket and Killmonger. Sort of a World of Dark Avengers, I guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T16:12:16-08:00","id":1177077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1174885-help-developing-a-idea-superheroes?p=1177034#post1177034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Heh <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Back when the Marvel movies were in phase one, I kept thinking that there had to be some sort of potential alternate universe/what if? story where the Avengers ended up being Stane's Iron Monger, Blonsky's Abomination, the thuggish jerk that was their first pick to be Captain America and ... well, I could never come up with an idea for Thor. I guess at this point, the group would also include Yellow Jacket and Killmonger. Sort of a World of Dark Avengers, I guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thor was his own jerkish counterpart before his redemption arc, really. Also, the aforementioned characters could all end up grouping together anyway, assuming that you made a Thor clone (far from unheard of in comic books, evil clones).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https:/